<title>JAPAN: Fujikura - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Fujikura - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		127.52		vs	  120.95</p>
<p> Operating	    3.26		vs	    1.87</p>
<p> Current		1.29		vs	  926    million</p>
<p> Net		  718    million	  vs	  597    million</p>
<p> EPS		    2.12 yen	  vs	    1.77 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    338 million	  vs	 338 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  2.50 yen	  vs	    2.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Fujikura Ltd is a large electric wire and cable maker.</p>
</text>
